# ASFA's club listing PDF is archived locally by tools/clubs.py, but never
# committed: alongside the four columns this project reads, it carries every
# club liaison's name, home address, phone number and email. Publishing the
# repo would publish all of it, undoing the extraction limits that clubs.py
# and check.py enforce. Re-fetch it with `python tools/clubs.py`.
data/clubs/raw/

# The LGRA and AOK9 grading guides are archived locally by tools/lgra.py and
# tools/aok9.py but never committed: the workbooks are large (2 MB a week for
# LGRA) and their header rows carry the registrars' mailing details. The parsed
# snapshots under data/lgra/snapshots and data/aok9/snapshots are the archive.
data/lgra/raw/
data/aok9/raw/
# The AOK9 Singles records workbook opens with the registrar's email and
# street address, for the same reason kept out.
data/aok9-singles/raw/
